     2395   PROCEDURE P-LINE :
     2396   UNDERLINE stream OutStream
     2397           sym3
     2398           gds-post-artic
     2399           sym12
     2400           gds-zap-gds-name
     2401           sym4
     2402           gds-zap-unit-base
